    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "OMD Estate Agents are delighted to introduce to the market this superb three-bedroom semi-detached home, constructed in 1994 by Shannon Homes and ideally positioned in the highly sought-after Stillorgan Heath development.\r\n\r\nOffering well-proportioned and versatile accommodation throughout, this attractive home benefits from a side entrance, generous off-street parking for three cars and a private, secluded rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room, kitchen/dining room, storage closet and convenient guest WC. Upstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an ensuite, together with a main family bathroom\r\nThis property enjoys a private walled garden with a paved area and a selection of mature shrubs and trees, while the secluded rear garden provides an excellent outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular highlight. The property is approximately 8 minutes’ walk from Stillorgan LUAS Station and the Stillorgan QBC, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The nearby Stillorgan area offers an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nFor outdoor enthusiasts, the property is also within easy walking distance of approximately 3 acres of recreational space, including a wonderful playground and attractive walking routes\r\n\r\nFamilies are exceptionally well catered for, with a wide selection of some of South County Dublin’s most prestigious primary and secondary schools located nearby. The property also enjoys convenient access to Stillorgan, Dundrum, Sandyford and Foxrock, with their excellent range of shopping, dining and leisure facilities. Dundrum Town Centre, Carrickmines Retail Park and Leopardstown Racecourse are also within easy reach\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent, with the LUAS at Stillorgan, Dublin Bus services and the Aircoach all readily accessible. The N11 and M50 motorway network, with access via Exit 14, provide easy connectivity to Dublin City Centre, approximately 9km away, as well as the surrounding suburbs and commuter routes\r\n\r\n58 Stillorgan Heath represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located home in a mature and highly desirable residential setting.\r\n\r\nWith much of the hard work already completed, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
